@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<div class="container py-4">
    <h1 class="mb-4">@ViewData["Title"]</h1>

    <div class="card">
        <div class="card-body">
            <p class="lead">Last updated: @DateTime.Now.ToString("MMMM dd, yyyy")</p>

            <h2 class="h4 mt-4">Overview</h2>
            <p>
                This application is a personal project designed to help manage a small daycare center.
                We are committed to protecting your privacy and handling your data with care and respect.
            </p>

            <h2 class="h4 mt-4">Information We Collect</h2>
            <p>To provide our daycare management services, we collect and store the following information:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Children's names and basic information</li>
                <li>Attendance records and working days</li>
                <li>Pricing and billing information</li>
            </ul>

            <h2 class="h4 mt-4">How We Use Your Information</h2>
            <p>The information collected is used exclusively for:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Managing daily attendance and schedules</li>
                <li>Generating invoices and billing records</li>
                <li>Maintaining accurate records for the daycare operation</li>
            </ul>

            <h2 class="h4 mt-4">Data Security</h2>
            <p>
                We take data security seriously. All information is stored securely in a protected database
                with appropriate access controls. We implement industry-standard security measures to protect
                your data from unauthorized access, disclosure, or misuse.
            </p>

            <h2 class="h4 mt-4">Data Retention</h2>
            <p>
                Your data is retained only for as long as necessary to provide our services and comply with
                legal obligations. When data is no longer needed, it is promptly and securely deleted from
                our systems.
            </p>

            <h2 class="h4 mt-4">Data Sharing</h2>
            <p>
                We do not share, sell, or distribute your personal information to third parties.
                This is a personal project for managing a small daycare, and all data remains within
                our secure system.
            </p>

            <h2 class="h4 mt-4">Your Rights</h2>
            <p>You have the right to:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Access your personal information</li>
                <li>Request correction of inaccurate data</li>
                <li>Request deletion of your data</li>
                <li>Withdraw consent for data processing</li>
            </ul>

            <h2 class="h4 mt-4">Changes to This Policy</h2>
            <p>
                We may update this privacy policy from time to time. Any changes will be reflected on this page
                with an updated revision date.
            </p>

            <h2 class="h4 mt-4">Contact</h2>
            <p>
                If you have any questions or concerns about this privacy policy or how your data is handled,
                please contact the daycare administrator.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
